From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: IvyCZE <me@ivy.yt>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 20:10:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Embermine: 0006-material-shapes

Add shared MaterialShapes containers for Compose icons and View toolbars,
using 40 dp primaryContainer backgrounds and onPrimaryContainer icons.
Restore circles and clamshells in the Firefox 161 drawer and circles for
connection and site-data controls in the site protection panel.

Both browser drawer renderers use Circle for commands, including expanded
submenus, and ClamShell for the library and navigation grids. Connection and
clear-site-data icons in the site protection panel use Circle.
Custom-tab drawer navigation uses ClamShell, and its toolbar menu and close
actions use Sunny, including caller-provided close-button artwork. Its library and navigation rows use
ClamShell, as do the four tab-tray selectors. Homepage shortcuts use Circle;
the homepage stories and private-mode buttons use Cookie12Sided.

The address-bar menu uses Sunny. Only the selected tab shows a close
button, with a Flower container.
The address-bar site-info icon and idle homepage microphone have no added
container. Search-edit microphone, Lens and QR actions and search engine
selector items use Cookie12Sided. The optional bottom navigation bar and
tab-strip new-tab button keep their original appearance.

Add shape containers to the remaining specified tab-tray, tab-group,
selection, Settings, History, Downloads and site-protection controls, plus
JVM tests for the shared shape mapping.

Co-authored-by: factory-droid[bot] <138933559+factory-droid[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>

